Written before any prose, from: the M4 packet and its three coordinator notes (the Quiet line and #49; inheritance from Movement 3; NO-SOURCE drafting) and its reconciliation marks; the coordinator's mid-task note on Movement 3's repair (Oryn's sum; Teague; the stopped reading); BOOK_MAP §1, §2 rows 19–22, §3, §5 (the Teague and Karis windows; the two hard rules), §6, §7 (the two private tests; the Arbiter row), §8, §9, §10 (the Ch8–10 units), §11, §12, §13; STATE_LEDGER with the three AFTER MOVEMENT blocks; OWNER-DECISIONS #18, #23, #24, #33, #42, #46, #48, #49, #50; `universe/UNIVERSE_BIBLE.md`, the observable-mechanics paragraph of the Quieting only; the edition's own chapters 12–22 read in full from disk (chapter 22 re-read after the repair landed), chapters 1–11 by search; the edition's Books 1 and 3 by search, for how a sigil and a declaration are met by the person who has them; packets 5 and 6 by search, as plans, for the handoff's geometry.

**No file under `books/` was opened, read, searched or listed.** Every scene's mechanics below are mine.

