+# Movement 004 source-distance tracking
+
+Independent side-by-side read of source chapters 8–10 against manuscript chapters 23–30. Protected units, wording quoted in `MOVEMENT-004.md`, and facts or event sequences required by the packet, `BOOK_MAP.md`, or `STATE_LEDGER.md` were excluded wherever the manuscript supplied a genuinely new telling.
+
